<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="In 3.1 Some abstract harmonic analysis ‣ 3 Frequencies of letters in 𝐭_{3/2} ‣ Symbols frequencies in the Thue–Morse word in base 3/2 and related conjectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Lift to <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math>-adic integers.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In 3.1 Some abstract harmonic analysis ‣ 3 Frequencies of letters in 𝐭_{3/2} ‣ Symbols frequencies in the Thue–Morse word in base 3/2 and related conjectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The dual group.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S3.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In 3.1 Some abstract harmonic analysis ‣ 3 Frequencies of letters in 𝐭_{3/2} ‣ Symbols frequencies in the Thue–Morse word in base 3/2 and related conjectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Characters.</span></a></li>
