</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS2" title="In 3 Frequencies of letters in 𝐭_{3/2} ‣ Symbols frequencies in the Thue–Morse word in base 3/2 and related conjectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.2 </span>Proof of <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS3" title="In 3 Frequencies of letters in 𝐭_{3/2} ‣ Symbols frequencies in the Thue–Morse word in base 3/2 and related conjectures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.3 </span>Proving that <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\zeta_{2}\|_{\infty}&lt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\zeta_{2}\|_{\infty}&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
